OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl stabbed 55 times by
OL,4,A14-year-old boy, murder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Freaders may find distressing
OL,9,FA teenage girl was stabbed "around 55
OL,10,Ftimes" by a 14-year-old boy, a murder
OL,11,Ftrial has been told.
OL,13,FLilly Jones, from Blaina, in Blaenau
OL,14,FGwent, was stabbed in the heart and
OL,15,Fboth lungs as well as an artery in her
OL,16,Fneck. There were 17 stab wounds to her
OL,17,Fneck, and knife wounds were found on
OL,18,Fher face, jaw, chest and bottom.
OL,20,FShe had left her home at about 18:30 on
OL,21,F20 June, telling her father she was
OL,22,F"popping out for a bit".
